cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DVAP in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
title: "DVAP: Damn Vulnerable Agentic Plant"
abstract: >-
  An intentionally vulnerable, fully simulated water-treatment plant operated by an LLM agent
  through MCP tools, for teaching and benchmarking the OWASP Top 10 for Agentic Applications
  (ASI01-ASI10) with physical consequences, plus a deterministic policy guard (SafeEnvelope)
  and a model benchmark harness.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/jxbani/DVAP"
authors:
  - name: "The DVAP Authors"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-18
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - agentic AI security
  - OWASP
  - LLM agents
  - Model Context Protocol
  - industrial control systems
  - prompt injection
  - capture the flag
  - security education
